WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.631
Explain behaviours that build good relationships at home, school and in the

00:00:04.631 --> 00:00:05.000
community.

00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:10.751
Good relationships grow through respect, love, honesty, friendliness, humility and

00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:15.147
helpful behaviour. Listening and speaking kindly can prevent conflict.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.246
When disagreements happen, we can discuss them without insults. A peaceful community

00:00:20.246 --> 00:00:24.185
is a place where people cooperate and care for one another.

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:29.641
Role-play a disagreement about borrowing an item and show a respectful solution.
